{
 "schemaVersion": 1,
 "testId": "mock-test-1",
 "items": {
  "1": [
   {
    "t": "given",
    "blocks": [
     {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "$m$, $l$, suvdagi qism $h_0=0{,}8l$"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "t": "p",
    "text": "Muvozanatda Arximed kuchi og‘irlikka teng: $\\rho_s S\\cdot 0{,}8l\\cdot g=mg$. Sterjen $x$ ga ko‘tarilganda suvdagi qismi $0{,}8l-x$ bo‘ladi, Arximed kuchi chiziqli kamayadi: $F_A=mg\\,\\dfrac{0{,}8l-x}{0{,}8l}$."
   },
   {
    "t": "p",
    "text": "Sekin (tezlanishsiz) ko‘tarish uchun kerakli kuch:"
   },
   {
    "t": "math",
    "tex": "F(x)=mg-F_A=mg\\,\\frac{x}{0{,}8l},\\qquad 0\\le x\\le 0{,}8l"
   },
   {
    "t": "p",
    "text": "Minimal energiya shu kuchning ishiga teng (grafik ostidagi uchburchak yuzi):"
   },
   {
    "t": "math",
    "tex": "E=\\int_0^{0{,}8l}\\frac{mg\\,x}{0{,}8l}\\,dx=\\frac{mg\\cdot 0{,}8l}{2}=0{,}4\\,mgl"
   },
   {
    "t": "answer",
    "blocks": [
     {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "**A)** $0{,}4\\,mgl$"
     }
    ]
   }
  ],
  "2": [
   {
    "t": "given",
    "blocks": [
     {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "$R_1=R,\\;R_2=R,\\;R_3=2R$; $R_2$ va $R_3$ parallel, $R_1$ ular bilan ketma-ket."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "t": "p",
    "text": "Butun tok $R_1$ dan o‘tadi: $I_1=I$. Parallel tarmoqlarda kuchlanish bir xil, tok qarshilikka teskari proporsional:"
   },
   {
    "t": "math",
    "tex": "\\frac{I_2}{I_3}=\\frac{R_3}{R_2}=2,\\qquad I_2+I_3=I\\;\\Rightarrow\\;I_2=\\frac{2}{3}I,\\;I_3=\\frac{1}{3}I"
   },
   {
    "t": "math",
    "tex": "I_1:I_2:I_3=1:\\tfrac{2}{3}:\\tfrac{1}{3}=3:2:1"
   },
   {
    "t": "answer",
    "blocks": [
     {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "**B)** $3:2:1$"
     }
    ]
   }
  ],
  "3": [
   {
    "t": "p",
    "text": "Har bir qaytishda nur yo‘nalishi $180^\\circ-2\\varphi$ ga buriladi ($\\varphi$ — nur bilan ko‘zgu orasidagi burchak). $\\alpha$ burchak ostidagi ikki ko‘zgudan ketma-ket qaytgan nur uchun burilish burchaklari yig‘indisi faqat ko‘zgular orasidagi burchakka bog‘liq:"
   },
   {
    "t": "math",
    "tex": "\\delta=360^\\circ-2(180^\\circ-\\alpha)=2\\alpha"
   },
   {
    "t": "p",
    "text": "Ya’ni chiqqan nur dastlabki yo‘nalishiga nisbatan $2\\alpha$ ga buriladi."
   },
   {
    "t": "answer",
    "blocks": [
     {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "**D)** $2\\alpha$"
     }
    ]
   }
  ],
  "4": [
   {
    "t": "given",
    "blocks": [
     {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "$x=A\\cos\\left(\\dfrac{\\pi t}{6}+\\dfrac{\\pi}{2}\\right)=-A\\sin\\dfrac{\\pi t}{6}$"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "t": "p",
    "text": "$t=0$ da $x=0$, ya’ni nuqta muvozanat holatidan harakatni boshlaydi. Birinchi chorak davr ichida bosib o‘tilgan yo‘l $s=|x|$:"
   },
   {
    "t": "math",
    "tex": "A\\sin\\frac{\\pi t}{6}=0{,}5A\\;\\Rightarrow\\;\\frac{\\pi t}{6}=\\frac{\\pi}{6}\\;\\Rightarrow\\;t=1\\ \\text{s}"
   },
   {
    "t": "p",
    "text": "(Davr $T=12$ s, chorak davr 3 s, demak $t=1$ s birinchi chorakda yotadi.)"
   },
   {
    "t": "answer",
    "blocks": [
     {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "**B)** 1 s"
     }
    ]
   }
  ],
  "5": [
   {
    "t": "given",
    "blocks": [
     {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "$T_A=300$ K, $V_A=0{,}3$ m³; $T_B=600$ K, $V_B=0{,}4$ m³; $T_C=1200$ K; $p_A=120$ kPa"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "t": "p",
    "text": "A, B, C nuqtalar bitta to‘g‘ri chiziqda yotadi. Chiziqning qiyaligi $\\dfrac{0{,}4-0{,}3}{600-300}=\\dfrac{1}{3000}$ m³/K, shuning uchun:"
   },
   {
    "t": "math",
    "tex": "V_C=0{,}3+\\frac{1200-300}{3000}=0{,}6\\ \\text{m}^3"
   },
   {
    "t": "p",
    "text": "Mendeleyev–Klapeyron tenglamasidan $p\\propto T/V$:"
   },
   {
    "t": "math",
    "tex": "\\frac{p_C}{p_A}=\\frac{T_C}{T_A}\\cdot\\frac{V_A}{V_C}=4\\cdot\\frac{0{,}3}{0{,}6}=2\\;\\Rightarrow\\;p_C=240\\ \\text{kPa}"
   },
   {
    "t": "math",
    "tex": "p_C-p_A=240-120=120\\ \\text{kPa}"
   },
   {
    "t": "answer",
    "blocks": [
     {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "**B)** 120 kPa"
     }
    ]
   }
  ],
  "6": [
   {
    "t": "given",
    "blocks": [
     {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "$v_0=10$ m/s, $g=10$ m/s²"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "t": "p",
    "text": "Ko‘tarilish vaqti $t_1=v_0/g=1$ s, maksimal balandlik $H=v_0^2/(2g)=5$ m. Jism 2 s da yerga qaytadi."
   },
   {
    "t": "p",
    "text": "Yo‘l faqat ortadi (kamaymaydi): 0–1 s da $s$ 0 dan 5 m gacha sekinlashib o‘sadi (grafik qavariq), 1–2 s da 5 dan 10 m gacha tezlashib o‘sadi. $t=1$ s da tezlik nolga teng, grafik gorizontal urinmaga ega."
   },
   {
    "t": "p",
    "text": "Boshqa grafiklar ko‘chishni yoki balandlikni ko‘rsatadi (yo‘l kamayishi mumkin emas)."
   },
   {
    "t": "answer",
    "blocks": [
     {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "**A)** — yo‘l 0 → 5 m → 10 m"
     }
    ]
   }
  ],
  "7": [
   {
    "t": "p",
    "text": "Yarim yemirilish davri — radioaktiv yadrolarning yarmi yemiriladigan **vaqt**. SI da vaqt sekundda o‘lchanadi."
   },
   {
    "t": "answer",
    "blocks": [
     {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "**D)** s"
     }
    ]
   }
  ],
  "8": [
   {
    "t": "p",
    "text": "Har bir zaryad atrofida uchta ekvipotensial sirt bor: kichik ($1$), o‘rta ($2$) va katta ($3$) sirt; qo‘shni sirtlar potensiali 3 V ga farq qiladi. Nuqtadagi potensial ikki zaryad potensiallari yig‘indisi, shuning uchun uni sirt raqamlari yig‘indisi $s$ belgilaydi: $\\varphi=\\varphi_0-3(s-2)$ V."
   },
   {
    "t": "p",
    "text": "Rasmdan: A — chap zaryadning 1-sirti va o‘ng zaryadning 3-sirtida ($s_A=4$); B — chapning 3-, o‘ngning 2-sirtida ($s_B=5$); C — chapning 1-, o‘ngning 2-sirtida ($s_C=3$)."
   },
   {
    "t": "math",
    "tex": "\\varphi_A-\\varphi_B=3\\ \\text{V},\\qquad \\varphi_A-\\varphi_C=-3\\ \\text{V}"
   },
   {
    "t": "p",
    "text": "Birlik zaryadni ko‘chirishda bajarilgan ish $A=q(\\varphi_1-\\varphi_2)$, modullari: $|A_B|=|A_C|=3$ J."
   },
   {
    "t": "answer",
    "blocks": [
     {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "**A)** $A_B=A_C$"
     }
    ]
   }
  ],
  "9": [
   {
    "t": "given",
    "blocks": [
     {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "$k=100$ N/m, $m=1$ kg, $v_{\\text{nisbiy,max}}=2$ m/s"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "t": "p",
    "text": "Jism ko‘zguga tik harakat qiladi. Tasvir ko‘zguga nisbatan simmetrik, uning tezligi jism tezligiga teng va qarama-qarshi. Shuning uchun jismning tasvirga nisbatan tezligi $2v$:"
   },
   {
    "t": "math",
    "tex": "2v_{\\max}=2\\ \\text{m/s}\\;\\Rightarrow\\;v_{\\max}=1\\ \\text{m/s}"
   },
   {
    "t": "math",
    "tex": "\\omega=\\sqrt{\\frac{k}{m}}=10\\ \\text{rad/s},\\qquad A=\\frac{v_{\\max}}{\\omega}=0{,}1\\ \\text{m}"
   },
   {
    "t": "answer",
    "blocks": [
     {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "**B)** 0,1 m"
     }
    ]
   }
  ],
  "10": [
   {
    "t": "p",
    "text": "Zaryad va massa sonlari saqlanadi:"
   },
   {
    "t": "math",
    "tex": "92=56+36+3Z\\;\\Rightarrow\\;Z=0,\\qquad 236=142+91+3A\\;\\Rightarrow\\;A=1"
   },
   {
    "t": "p",
    "text": "$Z=0$, $A=1$ — bu neytron."
   },
   {
    "t": "answer",
    "blocks": [
     {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "**A)** $^1_0n$"
     }
    ]
   }
  ],
  "11": [
   {
    "t": "given",
    "blocks": [
     {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "$B=2$ mT, $a=2$ m, $b=3$ m, $\\omega=\\pi/12$ rad/s, $t=30$ s"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "t": "p",
    "text": "Dastlab maydon ramka tekisligiga tik, oqim maksimal:"
   },
   {
    "t": "math",
    "tex": "\\Phi_0=BS=2\\cdot10^{-3}\\cdot 6=12\\ \\text{mWb}"
   },
   {
    "t": "p",
    "text": "$t$ vaqtda burilish burchagi $\\varphi=\\omega t=\\dfrac{\\pi}{12}\\cdot 30=2{,}5\\pi$, $\\Phi=\\Phi_0\\cos\\varphi=\\Phi_0\\cos 2{,}5\\pi=0$."
   },
   {
    "t": "math",
    "tex": "|\\Delta\\Phi|=12-0=12\\ \\text{mWb}"
   },
   {
    "t": "answer",
    "blocks": [
     {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "**B)** 12 mWb"
     }
    ]
   }
  ],
  "12": [
   {
    "t": "p",
    "text": "Lorens kuchi $\\vec F=q\\,\\vec v\\times\\vec B$, elektron uchun $q=-e$. $\\vec F$ ning $-z$ yo‘nalishda bo‘lishi uchun $\\vec v\\times\\vec B$ ko‘paytma $+z$ yo‘nalishda bo‘lishi kerak."
   },
   {
    "t": "math",
    "tex": "\\hat x\\times\\hat y=\\hat z\\;\\Rightarrow\\;\\vec B\\parallel +y"
   },
   {
    "t": "answer",
    "blocks": [
     {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "**D)** $y$ o‘qi bo‘ylab"
     }
    ]
   }
  ],
  "13": [
   {
    "t": "p",
    "text": "Idish suv bilan quyilish teshigi sathigacha to‘la. Jism suvda cho‘kmaydi, ya’ni suzadi. Suzish shartiga ko‘ra jism siqib chiqargan suvning og‘irligi jism og‘irligiga teng:"
   },
   {
    "t": "math",
    "tex": "m_{\\text{suv}}=m=3\\ \\text{kg}"
   },
   {
    "t": "p",
    "text": "Siqib chiqarilgan suvning hammasi B taroziga oqib tushadi."
   },
   {
    "t": "answer",
    "blocks": [
     {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "**C)** 3 kg"
     }
    ]
   }
  ],
  "14": [
   {
    "t": "p",
    "text": "Yo‘ldosh sirtga yaqin aylanadi ($r\\approx R$), markazga intilma tezlanishni tortishish kuchi beradi:"
   },
   {
    "t": "math",
    "tex": "\\frac{GM}{R^2}=\\frac{4\\pi^2R}{T^2}\\;\\Rightarrow\\;M=\\frac{4\\pi^2R^3}{GT^2}"
   },
   {
    "t": "math",
    "tex": "\\rho=\\frac{M}{\\frac43\\pi R^3}=\\frac{3\\pi}{GT^2}=\\frac{9}{GT^2}\\quad(\\pi=3)"
   },
   {
    "t": "answer",
    "blocks": [
     {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "**C)** $\\dfrac{9}{GT^2}$"
     }
    ]
   }
  ],
  "15": [
   {
    "t": "p",
    "text": "Suyuqlik shishani ho‘llasa, kapillarda suyuqlik idishdagi sathdan **yuqoriga ko‘tariladi**, menisk esa **botiq** bo‘ladi (chetlari devorga ko‘tarilgan)."
   },
   {
    "t": "p",
    "text": "Bu holat 2-chizmada tasvirlangan. Ho‘llamaydigan suyuqlikda esa sath pasayadi va menisk qavariq bo‘ladi."
   },
   {
    "t": "answer",
    "blocks": [
     {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "**B)** 2"
     }
    ]
   }
  ],
  "16": [
   {
    "t": "given",
    "blocks": [
     {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "Bir atomli ideal gaz, izobarik jarayon, $A=180$ kJ"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "t": "math",
    "tex": "A=p\\Delta V=\\nu R\\Delta T,\\qquad \\Delta U=\\frac32\\nu R\\Delta T=\\frac32A=270\\ \\text{kJ}"
   },
   {
    "t": "p",
    "text": "$\\Delta U>0$ — ichki energiya ortgan."
   },
   {
    "t": "answer",
    "blocks": [
     {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "**A)** 270 kJ ga ortgan"
     }
    ]
   }
  ],
  "17": [
   {
    "t": "given",
    "blocks": [
