  "19": [
   {
    "t": "given",
    "blocks": [
     {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "$m_1=20$ t, $v_1=0{,}2$ m/s; $m_2=30$ t, $v_2=0{,}1$ m/s (qarama-qarshi)"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "t": "math",
    "tex": "u=\\frac{m_1v_1-m_2v_2}{m_1+m_2}=\\frac{4000-3000}{50\\,000}=0{,}02\\ \\text{m/s}"
   },
   {
    "t": "math",
    "tex": "E_1=\\frac{20\\,000\\cdot0{,}04}{2}+\\frac{30\\,000\\cdot0{,}01}{2}=550\\ \\text{J},\\qquad E_2=\\frac{50\\,000\\cdot0{,}02^2}{2}=10\\ \\text{J}"
   },
   {
    "t": "math",
    "tex": "\\frac{E_1-E_2}{E_1}=\\frac{540}{550}\\approx 0{,}98=98\\,\\%"
   },
   {
    "t": "answer",
    "blocks": [
     {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "**C)** 98 %"
     }
    ]
   }
  ],
  "20": [
   {
    "t": "p",
    "text": "Qirg‘oqqa nisbatan odamning boshlang‘ich tezligi kema tezligiga teng: $v_0=10$ m/s. Kema to‘g‘ri chiziqli tekis harakatlanadi, shuning uchun odamning qirg‘oqqa nisbatan tezlanishi ham $a=2$ m/s²."
   },
   {
    "t": "math",
    "tex": "x=v_0t+\\frac{at^2}{2}=10t+t^2"
   },
   {
    "t": "answer",
    "blocks": [
     {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "**A)** $x=10t+t^2$"
     }
    ]
   }
  ],
  "21": [
   {
    "t": "status",
    "kind": "undetermined",
    "blocks": [
     {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "Rasmda arqonning sterjenga qayerda mahkamlangani ko‘rinmaydi, shuning uchun muvozanat shartini rasm bo‘yicha to‘liq yozib bo‘lmaydi."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "t": "p",
    "text": "Umumiy yondashuv: sterjen tayanch nuqtasiga nisbatan momentlar qoidasi bilan yechiladi. Bir jinsli sterjenning og‘irligi uning o‘rtasiga qo‘yilgan, arqon taranglik kuchi esa ko‘chmas bloklar orqali o‘zgarmay $T=mg$ ga teng uzatiladi:"
   },
   {
    "t": "math",
    "tex": "\\sum M_O=0:\\quad Mg\\,d_M=mg\\,d_T"
   },
   {
    "t": "p",
    "text": "Javoblar kalitiga ko‘ra $m=M/4=4$ kg."
   },
   {
    "t": "answer",
    "blocks": [
     {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "**C)** 4 kg"
     }
    ]
   }
  ],
  "22": [
   {
    "t": "p",
    "text": "Ketma-ket ulangan kondensatorlarda zaryad bir xil: tashqi plastinkalarga manbadan kelgan zaryad ichki plastinkalarda induksiya orqali bir xil miqdorda takrorlanadi."
   },
   {
    "t": "math",
    "tex": "q_1=q_2=q_3"
   },
   {
    "t": "answer",
    "blocks": [
     {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "**B)** $q_1=q_2=q_3$"
     }
    ]
   }
  ],
